	(text "Safety chain: reset/power-up -> all enables pulled low -> TX muted, PA drain off. Watchdog timeout -> WDT_OK low -> TX_ALLOW and PA_DRAIN_EN drop in hardware, independent of firmware."
	(at 297 20 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "0cce39aa-bed1-49b5-8d7d-919c27b9bd54")
)
	(text "Beam updates: BF_TX_LOAD / BF_RX_LOAD are shared by all four ADAR1000 (synchronous latch); never pulse both within 8 SCLK (DS p33-34)."
	(at 297 25 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "f34e2e3b-7511-45c9-be95-e8ee3a6d4551")
)
	(text "H2-B watchdog U702 (TPS3430 SBVS366A Table 6.6): CWD = 10k to VDD, SET0 = SET1 = GND -> window tWDL 9.0 ms (max 10.35) / tWDU 109 ms (min 92.7): kick WDI every 20-80 ms. CRST = 10k to VDD -> tRST 10 ms. SET pins hard-strapped so firmware cannot select 'watchdog disabled' (SET0=1, SET1=0). C702 = VDD1 0.1 uF bypass (DS recommended)."
	(at 297.18 40 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "1e725d06-25a2-4bc2-9727-0934375a6a56")
)
	(text "U701 decoupling per ST DS12589 Fig 16: VDD pins 23/35/48 = C703/C704/C705 100 nF + C706 4.7 uF;\nVDDA pin 21 = C707 10 nF + C708 1 uF; VREF+ pin 20 = C709 100 nF + C710 1 uF (all on +1V8_DIG).\nVREF+ is tied to VDDA: ST requires VREF+ = VDDA when VDDA < 2 V (DS12589 3.11.1).\nVBAT pin 1: no capacitor (no value in DS12589) - UNRESOLVED.\nPC4 (pin 16) = PG_5VPA input (U651 PGOOD, 100k pull-up R676 on PWR_MAIN)."
	(at 294.64 250.19 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "0b7197ab-84d4-4f64-b0b9-5fbdce1f43ae")
)
	(text "REC (H2C_SEQUENCING_SIM rev 2 item 7): R735 1k in series U705 Y -> PA_DRAIN_EN (BAT54C D961 clamp to PG_3V3RF on PA_INTERLOCK sheet)."
	(at 200.66 27.94 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "3342357a-824b-4d41-8fc6-04ea11e5c887")
)
